    "text": "Lufkin\nInside Texas Death Row: Lufkin Murderer is Texas Death Row’s Longest Resident\nBy Danny Merrell,\n44 minutes agoThere are 90 inmates on Death Row in Texas. No current prisoner has been on Death Row longer than Harvey Earvin. On October 26, 2025, Earvin will mark his 48th year on this dubious list—his crime - the slaying of a 75-year-old man outside a gas station in Lufkin, Texas.",
